{"id":"en_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire","title":"Undercover Boss My Tacky Billionaire","titleEn":"Undercover Boss My Tacky Billionaire","description":"Emily, a public relations queen, is forced to accept a near-impossible assignment in her bid for a partner position: within one week, she must transform her firm's biggest client's illegitimate son into a polished celebrity—and pose as his fiancée. The problem is Liam, the son in question, who wears gold chains and floral shirts, drinks Lafite through a straw, and greets her with the blunt question, \"How much for a night, beautiful?\" The makeover becomes a hilarious battle. Dramzio lets viewers follow this series and its episodes.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Hidden Identity","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuy0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuy0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuy0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_undercover-boss-my-tacky-billionaire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diuy0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_undercover-boss-my-tack